                                                             a cas-arch:Requirement.
f36d94e1ce5e4307acf8e9d7:Requirement_2-2-2_Internal-Power-Supply dc:description "The Mars Rover shall have a power supply fulfilling all of the following conditions:* it contains an energy storage system* it contains an energy management system* it contains a power distribution system";
