f36d94e1ce5e4307acf8e9d7:Requirement_2-3-2_Motion-over-Obstacles dc:description "The Mars Rover shall be able to move by itself over obstacles which fullfill one of the following condition:* the obstacle is max. 20 cm high* the slope angle uphil is max. 30 degree* the slope angle downhil is max. 30 degree* the roll angle of the Mars Rover since moving over the obstacle never exceeds an angle of 30 degree";
                                                                 dc:identifier "_17_0_3_1_60c0217_1554373947238_635549_17411";
                                                                 dc:title "Motion over Obstacles";
