f36d94e1ce5e4307acf8e9d7:Requirement_2-7_Mars-Rover-Capabilities dc:description "The Mars Rover shall be able to execute the following operations individually and not in combination:* Moving on Mars surface* Capturing optical information* Capturing video information* Capturing audio information* Sampling of Probes of solid material of individual diameter not bigger than 20 mm* Sampling of probes of fluid material in the range of ph-value 0 to 11* Sampling of probes of gas of not more than 50 mm³ volume and pressure between 1 hPa up to 3.000 hPa* Sampling of biological probes of not more than 50 mm³ volume and not more than 30 mm length in any direction";
                                                                 dc:identifier "_2021x_2_8d501e7_1710152920321_382759_5749";
                                                                 dc:title "Mars Rover Capabilities";
                                                                 :number "2.7";
                                                                 :type "MDReqIF_1712564283461_752038_19";
                                                                 a cas-arch:Requirement.
f36d94e1ce5e4307acf8e9d7:Requirement_2-8-1_Landing-Temperatures dc:description "The Mars Rover shall resist temperatures of not more than 100°C for not more than 7 minutes while staying full functional.";
                                                                dc:identifier "_2021x_2_8d501e7_1710150476050_13127_5658";
                                                                dc:title "Landing Temperatures";
                                                                :number "2.8.1";
                                                                :type "MDReqIF_1712564283513_737771_74";
                                                                a cas-arch:Requirement.
f36d94e1ce5e4307acf8e9d7:Requirement_2-8-2_Landing-Deceleration dc:description "The Mars Rover shall be able to withstand landing deceleration as listed below:* Deceleration from 20.000 km/h at Mars atmosphere entry to 1.500 km/h in 4 minutes.* Deceleration from 1.500 km/s to 25 m/s in 3 minutes";
                                                                dc:identifier "_2021x_2_8d501e7_1710150561344_954069_5661";
                                                                dc:title "Landing Deceleration";
