f36d94e1ce5e4307acf8e9d7:Requirement_2-8-3_Landing-speed dc:description "The Mars Rover shall be full operable after a landing on Mars with the following conditions beeing true:* The vertical speed at ground contact is not higher than 1 m/s* The horizontal speed at graund contact is not higher than 1 m/s";
                                                         dc:identifier "_2021x_2_8d501e7_1710150880576_958104_5666";
                                                         dc:title "Landing speed";
